      ],
      "text": "For red teaming, the surface area of potential risks is extremely large. As a result, our approach involves extensive threat modeling, &amp; automated evals to identify risks.\n\nThen our process enables capable experts to identify key risks, and report them back to model developers. https://t.co/1bN3B6EXkV",
