          }
        ],
        "text": "Read more coverage on @TechCrunch by @Kyle_L_Wiggers:\n\nhttps://t.co/I5lUib7Qas"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "615818451",
        "created_at": "2023-08-24T15:41:03.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1694736584841814124"
        ],
        "id": "1694736584841814124",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 2,
          "impression_count": 5374,
          "like_count": 37,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 3
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1694736583466041487",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We executed a pilot with @brexHQ on fine-tuning the models and where the fine-tuned GPT-3.5 model outperformed base GPT-3.5 66% of the time.\n\nWe see strong evidence that you can fine-tune GPT-3.5 to provide dramatically better performance.\n\nhttps://t.co/CaqJwb1MMZ"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "615818451",
        "created_at": "2023-08-24T15:41:02.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1694736583466041487"
        ],
        "id": "1694736583466041487",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 140,
          "impression_count": 279023,
          "like_count": 683,
          "quote_count": 15,
          "reply_count": 16,
          "retweet_count": 70
        },
        "text": "We @scale_ai are announcing a strategic partnership @OpenAI today to be their preferred partner for enterprise fine-tuning.\n\nWe are excited about the future of providing the perfect model for each enterprise's unique needs.\n\nRead more in 🧵\n\nhttps://t.co/TdAa7R93SW"
      },
      {
        "attachments": {
          "media_keys": [
            "3_1691903206333493252"
          ]
        },
        "author_id": "16071952",
        "created_at": "2023-08-16T20:03:09.000Z",
